1
00:00:00,855 --> 00:00:02,725
(Amy:)Been 15 minutes.
Just sayin'.

2
00:00:02,723 --> 00:00:04,603
(Sheldon:)Okay. I can do this.

3
00:00:04,609 --> 00:00:06,059
(Sheldon:)Just give me a moment...

4
00:00:07,395 --> 00:00:08,865
(Sheldon:)Oh!

5
00:00:08,863 --> 00:00:11,063
(Sheldon:)Mimosas coming up.

6
00:00:11,065 --> 00:00:13,195
(Bert:)I once left orange juice
in my fridge so long,

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:16,150
(Bert:)it tasted like a mimosa.

8
00:00:16,153 --> 00:00:18,233
How old was it?

9
00:00:18,239 --> 00:00:19,739
(Bert:)It's hard to say.

10
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:22,160
(Bert:)I don't remember much
after I drank it.

11
00:00:23,995 --> 00:00:25,875
(Sheldon:)Would you like one,
Mrs. Petrescu?

12
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:29,720
(Mrs Petrescu:)Yes. Drink is fun
and good friends-- Applebee's.

13
00:00:32,169 --> 00:00:34,969
(Sheldon:)She's learning English from TV.

14
00:00:35,756 --> 00:00:38,086
(Mrs Petrescu:)TV, good. Now back to you.

15
00:00:39,977 --> 00:00:41,507
(Stuart:)Hey, guys.

16
00:00:41,512 --> 00:00:42,562
(Amy:)Hi, Stuart.

17
00:00:42,563 --> 00:00:43,763
(Stuart:)These are for you.

18
00:00:43,764 --> 00:00:45,894
(Amy:)Oh, they're pretty.
Thank you.

19
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:48,270
(Sheldon:)Stuart, this is Bert
from the Caltech geology lab,

20
00:00:48,269 --> 00:00:50,739
(Sheldon:)and this is Mrs. Petrescu
from downstairs.

21
00:00:50,738 --> 00:00:51,438
(Stuart:)Nice to meet you.

22
00:00:51,439 --> 00:00:52,769
- Hello.
- Hey.

23
00:00:52,773 --> 00:00:54,103
(Stuart:)So, what did I miss?

24
00:00:54,108 --> 00:00:56,438
(Bert:)Eh, we watched Sheldon
try to open a bottle

25
00:00:56,444 --> 00:00:59,024
(Bert:)for 15 minutes.

